<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Petronas year pre-tax profit 12.39 bln rgt.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Petronas year pre-tax profit 12.39 bln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>		     (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit    12,390.0	vs    8,560.0</p>
<p>    Turnover	    28,890.0	vs   22,250.0</p>
<p>    Net profit	   7,280.0	vs    6,760.0</p>
<p>    Total assets	68,160.0	vs   58,050.0</p>
<p>    Shareholder funds 27,320.0	vs   23,120.0</p>
<p>Note - Full name of state-owned oil corporation is Petroliam Nasional Bhd. Net profit is after minorities and extraordinaries.  </p>
<p>Minorities in 1997 period less 818 million ringgit vs less 591 million ringgit in 1996. Extraordinaries 4.00 million ringgit in 1997 period vs 1.087 billion ringgit gain from listing Petronas Gas.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 206 2323)</p>
</text>
